msgstr ""

#. Description of the plugin
#: apipj-consulta-cnpj.php
msgid "Autofills company name and address from a Brazilian CNPJ at the WooCommerce checkout (classic and block-based), in My Account and in any form, using the apipj CNPJ API."
msgstr ""

